      "cooked": "<p>What’s the worst that can happen when you team up with Setback?</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-187-writers-room-dark-watch-vol-1-137\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-187-writers-room-dark-watch-vol-1-137\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2195fb0b2700b1df502aa120a68af896730a6609.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-187-writers-room-dark-watch-vol-1-137\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #187 - Writers' Room: Dark Watch Vol. 1 #137</a></h3>\n\n  <p>The kids are alright! Or are they?  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:27:25 What sort of mess are these two going to get themselves into? And how will they get out of it? You'll just have to listen and find out! Thank you all for supporting our ENNIES Awards...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/6fd8d3d645bdece7e56806681480d26b7e353f63.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/6fd8d3d645bdece7e56806681480d26b7e353f63\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6fd8d3d645bdece7e56806681480d26b7e353f63_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"fXry65uwMlbFiJinsMKvJN5UDvl\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6fd8d3d645bdece7e56806681480d26b7e353f63_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6fd8d3d645bdece7e56806681480d26b7e353f63_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6fd8d3d645bdece7e56806681480d26b7e353f63_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">4519×7000 3.26 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
