      "created_at": "2021-09-01T09:37:37.675Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don’t think they’ve given her that name before, but I was assuming she’s the Vampire that Apex has as part of his pact with the Court of Blood. Apex uses her as a prize to show off his strength to the Werewolves, but she’s also his link to Countess Bathory, so things are a bit fraught.</p>\n<p>She was described but not named in the Dark Watch Foes and Werewolf stories episodes. I just checked, and she’s not one of the vampires named in the Court of Blood deck</p>",
