    {
      "id": 240239,
      "name": "Jeysie",
      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-09-01T11:05:28.872Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I honestly want more Setback &amp; Harpy teamup stories now. They’re just adorable like a kid brother and sister. There’s also the big hilarity in how they essentially failed their way to victory.</p>\n<p>Expatriette keeps collecting the horror movie tropes about her, I see. That poor woman. Although “Citizen Mom” was morbidly hilarious.</p>\n<p>The entire thing with Mr. Fixer was, I would argue, some of the best dark comedy the podcast has come up with thus far.</p>\n<p>I honestly had to kinda laugh at Christopher being all like “I thought we already answered this” while reading my letter because he <em>did</em> already answer it. I actually wrote it right before the La Comodora in the Extremeverse episode, but in that episode he answered why Con has a gender in response to someone else’s letter so I shrugged off having accidentally written a duplicate letter (which has happened a number of times for me). As such, I was very surprised when he answered it here anyway. Lol.</p>",
