      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-09-01T17:34:43.476Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Burrower\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"28772\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/burrower/48/5119_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Burrower:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don’t think they’ve given her that name before, but I was assuming she’s the Vampire that Apex has as part of his pact with the Court of Blood.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah I kinda puzzled that out from context, but I’m glad I’m not the only one who didn’t recognize the name.  C&amp;A seem to have just assumed we already knew it, having presumably decided it off-air and then forgot they did, or maybe it was in a section which Trevor edited out, whoops.</p>\n<p>Speaking of names, by the way, you wouldn’t happen to be “Striped-Burrower-Turns-The-Earth”, would you?</p>",
