    {
      "id": 264708,
      "name": "",
      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-12-24T19:03:24.103Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The thing about Mister Fixer being buried makes me think of various Kai scenes from Lexx.</p>\n<p>I absolutely loved the favorite bird question.  I thought at first that Fixer had to be the American eagle, but the pigeon or sparrow is definitely a better answer.</p>\n<p>“Divorced and then dead.” Well now I know exactly what story I want to tell about Setback.  (And conversely, I also know what story about prison dating Harpy want to tell.  But you don’t want me to tell that one here either.)</p>\n<p>“Is seeming being”?  Well, I know that living in the limelight is the universal dream, for those who wish to seem; those who wish to be must put away their alienation, get on with the fascination, the New Creation, the underlying theme of all Biomancer stories.</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
